flowchart TD
N_start["**Start** 
Initiate NSGA II based optimization to adjust three buffers in the production simulation"]

N_buffer_capacity_problem["**BufferCapacityProblem** 
Attributes: n_var n_obj n_constr xl {1-10} xu {1-10} n_replications base_seed n_cores 
Methods: __init__ _evaluate"]

N_nsga2_setup["**NSGA2 Setup** 
Attributes: pop_size n_gen sampling crossover mutation termination 
Methods: __init__"]

N_parallel_evaluation["**Parallel Evaluation** 
Process: Prepare tasks for each candidate and evaluate in parallel using multiprocessing"]

N_run_simulation["**Run Simulation** 
Calls run_simulation with caps and seeds to obtain throughput and wip"]

N_objectives["**Compute Objectives** 
Attributes: none 
Methods: wip throughput objective calculation"]

N_nsga2_loop["**NSGA2 Loop** 
Process: Update population using NSGA2 and iterate until termination"]

N_termination_check["**Termination Check** 
Decision: if generation limit reached stop else continue loop"]

N_results["**Pareto Front** 
Description: Set of buffer capacities with corresponding wip and throughput"]

N_export_results["**Export Results** 
Description: Save Pareto front to CSV for decision support"]

N_end["**End** 
Description: Provide actionable buffer design options to management"]

N_start --> N_buffer_capacity_problem
N_buffer_capacity_problem --> N_nsga2_setup
N_nsga2_setup --> N_parallel_evaluation
N_parallel_evaluation --> N_run_simulation
N_run_simulation --> N_objectives
N_objectives --> N_nsga2_loop
N_nsga2_loop --> N_parallel_evaluation
N_nsga2_loop --> N_termination_check
N_termination_check --> N_results
N_results --> N_export_results
N_export_results --> N_end